{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"n1","type":"text","text":"## 1 · Compte de domaine\n\nAssume breach — AD lisible par tout compte.\n\n- [[Cheatsheet - Reconnaissance AD|Énumérer]] largement\n- [[Cheatsheet - Kerberoasting|Kerberoasting]] (compte à SPN)\n- [[Cheatsheet - BloodHound SharpHound|BloodHound]] → chemin vers DA","x":0,"y":220,"width":380,"height":240},
		{"id":"n_legend","type":"text","text":"### Carte d'attaque interactive\n\nClique un lien pour ouvrir la fiche.\n\n- Cyan : point d'entrée\n- Rouge : objectif (DA / EA)\n- Orange : voie transverse\n\nCours : [[Attack flow]]","x":-600,"y":120,"width":341,"height":210},
		{"id":"n4","type":"text","text":"## 4 · Hash / clé AES\n\n- [[Cheatsheet - Lateral movement|OverPass-the-Hash]]\n- Compte de service → [[Cheatsheet - Tickets Kerberos|Silver Ticket]]\n- Compte privilégié → Domain Admin","x":540,"y":975,"width":380,"height":200},
		{"id":"n3","type":"text","text":"## 3 · Admin local\n\n- [[Cheatsheet - Post-exploitation|Dump des secrets]] (SafetyKatz)\n- Chasse d'une session DA\n- Unconstrained + coercition → [[Cheatsheet - Delegation attacks|TGT du DC]]","x":540,"y":675,"width":380,"height":230},
		{"id":"n_adcs","type":"text","text":"## Voie AD CS\n\nDomain User → certificat au nom d'un DA → TGT.\n\n[[Cheatsheet - AD CS et certificats|ESC1 / ESC3]]","x":-760,"y":965,"width":380,"height":160,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n2","type":"text","text":"## 2 · Droit ACL\n\n- ForceChangePassword → reset d'un user\n- GenericWrite computer → [[Cheatsheet - RBCD|RBCD]]\n- GenericWrite user → targeted Kerberoast\n- GPO liée à une OU → [[Cheatsheet - GPO et OU|exécution]]\n\nDétail : [[Cheatsheet - ACL et droits AD]]","x":-760,"y":675,"width":380,"height":230},
		{"id":"n5","type":"text","text":"## 5 · Domain Admin\n\n- [[Cheatsheet - Persistence|DCSync]] → hash de krbtgt\n- [[Cheatsheet - Tickets Kerberos|Golden / Diamond]]\n- [[Cheatsheet - Persistence|DSRM]]\n- Extraire la clé de trust →","x":-10,"y":1265,"width":390,"height":215,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"n_mssql","type":"text","text":"## Voie MSSQL\n\nCompte de domaine → database links → RCE.\n\n[[Cheatsheet - MSSQL et PowerUpSQL|PowerUpSQL]]","x":-640,"y":1215,"width":380,"height":180,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n6","type":"text","text":"## 6 · Enterprise Admin / forêt\n\n- Enfant → parent : SID History (519) → EA\n- Inter-forêt : referral, SID filtré\n\nDétail : [[Cheatsheet - Trusts et forêts]]","x":-15,"y":1640,"width":400,"height":190,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"n_start","type":"text","text":"## Accès réseau\n\nAucun compte.\nObjectif : obtenir une identité valide (creds, null session, AS-REP).","x":20,"y":-60,"width":340,"height":160,"color":"5"}
	],
